# Meal Mastery

**A meal-planning and pantry-management Android application built with React Native, Expo, and TypeScript.**

Meal Mastery was created to make weekly meal planning easier by bringing meal generation, pantry awareness, recipes, shopping lists, and cooking guidance into one application.

Rather than treating meal planning as a simple list of recipes, Meal Mastery considers user preferences and available ingredients to help turn the question **“What should I make this week?”** into an actionable plan.

## Features

### 7-Day Meal Planning

Meal Mastery provides a complete weekly planning workflow, allowing users to generate and organize meals across seven days.

### Preference-Based Meal Generation

Users can configure meal preferences that influence the meals selected by the generator, making generated plans more relevant than purely random recipe selection.

### Pantry Management

The pantry system allows users to track ingredients they already have available.

Meal Mastery can use pantry information when evaluating meals, helping users make better use of ingredients they already own.

### Expiry Awareness

Pantry items can be considered based on expiry, allowing the application to prioritize ingredients that should be used sooner.

This adds another dimension to meal recommendations beyond simple ingredient matching.

### Ingredient-Aware Recipe Scoring

Recipes can be evaluated against pantry contents to determine how well they match ingredients already available to the user.

This helps reduce unnecessary purchases and makes generated meal plans more practical.

### Automated Shopping Lists

Once meals are planned, Meal Mastery helps translate the plan into an actionable shopping list.

This connects planning and execution rather than requiring users to manually review every recipe and reconstruct the ingredients they need.

### 168 Built-In Recipes

Meal Mastery includes a library of 168 recipes spanning a variety of meals and cooking styles.

### Cook Mode

Cook Mode provides a focused interface for following a recipe while preparing it, reducing the need to navigate through the rest of the application while cooking.

